{"seq":2,"slug":"bounded-modules-narrow-interfaces","title":"有界模块与窄接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/context-and-boundaries/bounded-modules-narrow-interfaces","wordCount":2228,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"有界模块与窄接口\">有界模块与窄接口</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>上下文窗口再大,也是有限资源,而且窗口越大、注意力越稀薄。agent 无法理解整个大型系统,但完全可以理解一个边界清晰的模块——「有界模块 + 窄接口」正是把「读懂整个系统」这个不可能任务,降解成「读懂一个模块」的可行任务的结构化手段。2025 年以来多 agent 并行开发成为常态(worktree 隔离会话、云端临时容器跑任务),边界的意义从个人工程习惯升级为协作基础设施:没有清晰边界,并行就是互相踩踏。本节讲清边界如何框定理解范围、窄接口为何是协作契约、以及如何用边界组织 agent 的工作分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本章的两个词各有一个可度量的含义:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有界模块</strong>:把「读懂整个系统」这个不可能任务降解成「读懂一个模块」——高内聚让模块内部的概念自洽完整,边界把「改这里会不会炸那里」变成可检验的不变量。</li>\n<li><strong>装载公式</strong>:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>内</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = M_{内} + \\sum_{i} I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,即模块内部概念加上它依赖的每个模块的接口概念;边界同时压低这两项,agent 才装得下、装得对。</li>\n<li><strong>窄接口</strong>:深模块的接口窄、实现深,深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = n/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越好;接口是契约,只要它不变,两侧可独立演化。</li>\n<li><strong>粒度的权衡</strong>:边界过碎则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 暴增,过宽则超出可装载范围,校准原则是「一个边界内的知识量 ≈ 一个典型任务所需的理解量」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"边界让局部理解成为可能\">边界让局部理解成为可能</h2><p>一个 agent 要安全地改代码,必须装载的概念集合可以写成:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>内</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = M_{内} + \\sum_{i} I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,即目标模块内部的概念 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>内</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{内}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,加上它依赖的每个模块的接口概念 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。模块边界的作用是压低两项:高内聚让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>内</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{内}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 自洽完整——所需的类型、不变量、错误语义都在边界内,不必跳出四处追查;窄接口让每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只占几个签名的大小。两者都小,agent 才装得下、装得对。</p>\n<p>边界还把「改这里会不会炸那里」从祈望变成可检验的不变量:只要不动接口,模块内部的任何重构对外部都是不可见的。这让 agent 敢于在边界内大胆修改,也让 review 者能机械地判断风险——diff 是否触碰了接口文件,一眼可查。</p>\n<p>第三个收益常被低估:<strong>可独立验证</strong>。有界模块可以在模块层面单独测试,不必拉起整个系统。agent 的自我纠错回路依赖快速反馈——跑一个 3 秒的模块测试与跑一个 5 分钟的集成套件,试错迭代次数相差一个数量级。</p>\n<p>粒度上存在真实的权衡:边界切得过碎,胶水层和跨边界跳转暴增,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反而变大;切得过宽,单模块超出可装载范围。一个实用的校准原则:<strong>一个边界内的知识量 ≈ 一个典型任务所需的理解量</strong>。任务总是横跨多个模块才能完成,通常说明粒度或划法有问题(见第四节)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窄接口是协作契约\">窄接口是协作契约</h2><p>John Ousterhout 在《A Philosophy of Software Design》中提出 deep module:最好的模块接口窄、实现深,以少量公开方法封装大量内部复杂度。若实现涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个概念、对外暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个,则深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = n / k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越好。对 agent 而言,使用深模块只需理解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个签名;修改深模块的内部也几乎不波及外部。深模块因此是 AI 友好架构的黄金单元;依赖方向与健康度的量化核算(不稳定度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>),见<a href=\"../legibility-and-navigation/locality-and-modularity\">局部性与模块化</a>。</p>\n<p>接口的价值在于它是<strong>契约</strong>:只要接口不变,模块两侧可以独立演化,agent 改一侧时另一侧被接口豁免。工业协议已经把这个思想做成了基础设施——MCP 把每个工具定义为「名称 + inputSchema + 行为注解」的最小接口,规范允许工具携带 <code>readOnlyHint</code>、<code>destructiveHint</code> 等注解描述副作用,并要求客户端在服务器不可信时将注解本身视为不可信(<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-06-18/server/tools\">Tools 规范</a>)。调用方无需阅读任何实现细节即可做出安全决策,这正是窄接口的教科书式形态。</p>\n<p>反面证据同样来自实践:当几十个工具的定义被整体塞进上下文,token 开销迅速失控。Anthropic 给出的解法是把工具改为文件系统上的代码 API,agent 按需 import 所需部分而非预载全部定义,上下文开销最多降低约 98.7%(<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/code-execution-with-mcp\">Code execution with MCP</a>,2025-11-04);Cloudflare 随后独立发表了同思路的 Code Mode。结论一致:<strong>宽接口在物理上不可扩展</strong>,暴露面越宽,agent 每次跨模块协作要背负的死重越大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>宽接口 / 泄漏抽象</th>\n<th>窄接口 / 深模块</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>agent 需装载的信息</td>\n<td>全部公开面 + 内部类型</td>\n<td>少量签名 + 行为注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改动牵连面</td>\n<td>实现细节变动即破坏调用方</td>\n<td>接口不变则外部免疫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 agent 冲突面</td>\n<td>大,人人可触达一切</td>\n<td>小,收敛到接口文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试策略</td>\n<td>只能端到端验证</td>\n<td>模块级独立测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型症状</td>\n<td>「改一行、崩三处」</td>\n<td>diff 局部、评审一眼定险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph W[&quot;宽接口形态&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;agent&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;预载全部 12 个公开方法定义&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[&quot;任一内部细节变动都可能波及调用方&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph N[&quot;窄接口形态&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;agent&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;仅装载 3 个签名与行为注解&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[&quot;实现自由演化外部无感&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph W[\"宽接口形态\"]\n        A1[\"agent\"] --&gt; B1[\"预载全部 12 个公开方法定义\"]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[\"任一内部细节变动都可能波及调用方\"]\n    end\n    subgraph N[\"窄接口形态\"]\n        A2[\"agent\"] --&gt; B2[\"仅装载 3 个签名与行为注解\"]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[\"实现自由演化外部无感\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"用边界组织-agent-与多-agent-工作\">用边界组织 agent 与多 agent 工作</h2><p>边界首先是任务分配的单位。「改进模块 X 使其满足验收 T」是一个自洽、可独立验证的任务;而「实现一个横跨五个模块的功能」交给 agent,等于让它同时持有五份局部真相——冲突与半成品状态几乎不可避免。更高效的模式是<strong>接口先行</strong>:人先与 agent 一起敲定新模块的窄接口与验收命令,再把实现托付给它在边界内完成;契约锁住边界,实现可以放手。</p>\n<p>多 agent 并行还需要执行层的隔离,它与设计层边界互补但不可混谈:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>git worktree</strong>:Claude Code 提供 <code>claude --worktree feature-auth</code>,每个 worktree 是独立检出、独立分支的并行会话,互不覆盖文件(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/common-workflows\">common-workflows</a>)。</li>\n<li><strong>云端临时环境</strong>:GitHub Copilot 的 cloud agent 为每个任务分配由 GitHub Actions 驱动的 ephemeral 开发环境,自行建分支、提交、推送,完成后开 PR 供人审(<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/agents/coding-agent/about-coding-agent\">About cloud agent</a>)。</li>\n<li><strong>设计级边界</strong>:worktree 解决的是文件系统互踩,解决不了语义冲突——两个 agent 各改一个模块却共用一份数据结构定义,合并时照样打架。隔离栈的完备顺序是:执行隔离 ⊂ 模块边界 ⊂ 接口稳定,外层永远兜不住内层缺失。执行隔离与按风险分级的自主度如何配合,见<a href=\"../verifiability-and-safe-change/small-reversible-changes\">小步可逆的变更</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>边界不是一次划定的永久结构。当某一类改动总是横跨两个模块,这是边界划错的直接证据——该拆开或该合并,而不是加一层适配硬凑。MCP 的演化方式提供了参照:客户端与服务端可同时支持多个协议版本,新旧并存、按请求协商(<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/versioning\">Versioning</a>);边界迁移同理,允许过渡期双轨,比一刀切换血更安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>接口评审四问,用于 PR 与设计文档的机械自查:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>不通过的信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能否一句话说清模块职责?</td>\n<td>描述里出现「以及」「还有」超过两次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用方是否需要 import 内部类型?</td>\n<td>公开签名泄漏了实现专有类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有不读实现即可判定对错的测试?</td>\n<td>测试断言依赖内部调用序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用与错误语义是否写在接口上?</td>\n<td>调用方靠读源码才知道会发什么</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>并行开发的最小命令集:<code>git worktree add ../repo-feat-a -b feat-a</code> 建立隔离检出,完成后合并清理;使用 Claude Code 时可直接 <code>claude --worktree &lt;name&gt;</code> 一条命令起并行会话。给 agent 下任务时固定四要素模板:<strong>目标模块、禁区清单、验收命令、是否允许动接口</strong>——最后一项默认为否,接口变更必须显式授权并升版本号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>边界把系统的理解需求收敛到单个模块之内,窄接口再把跨模块成本压到几个签名的量级,二者相乘,agent 才获得了「只懂局部也能正确工作」的前提。执行隔离解决不了设计缺陷,worktree 之上仍需模块边界与稳定契约兜底。边界划错的可观测证据是横向改动清单——它出现时,调整边界本身就是最划算的重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有界模块与窄接口","id":"有界模块与窄接口"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"边界让局部理解成为可能","id":"边界让局部理解成为可能"},{"level":2,"text":"窄接口是协作契约","id":"窄接口是协作契约"},{"level":2,"text":"用边界组织 agent 与多 agent 工作","id":"用边界组织-agent-与多-agent-工作"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器可读的上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/context-and-boundaries/machine-readable-context"},"next":{"title":"面向 Agent 持续演进架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/context-and-boundaries/evolving-architecture-for-agents"}}